{"id": 7419, "date": "2026-09-01T13:07:29", "date_gmt": "2026-09-01T13:07:29", "guid": {"rendered": "https://artibits.com/?p=7419", "raw": "https://artibits.com/?p=7419"}, "modified": "2026-09-17T13:14:19", "modified_gmt": "2026-09-17T13:14:19", "password": "", "slug": "fabrication-pack-automation-for-modular-well-pad-infrastructure", "status": "publish", "type": "post", "link": "https://artibits.com/2026/09/01/fabrication-pack-automation-for-modular-well-pad-infrastructure/", "title": {"raw": "Fabrication-Pack Automation for Modular Well-Pad Infrastructure", "rendered": "Fabrication-Pack Automation for Modular Well-Pad Infrastructure"}, "content": {"raw": "<!-- wp:paragraph {\"style\":{\"elements\":{\"link\":{\"color\":{\"text\":\"var:preset|color|black\"}}}},\"textColor\":\"black\",\"fontSize\":\"medium\"} -->\n<p class=\"has-black-color has-text-color has-link-color has-medium-font-size\"><strong>How Artisan Reduced Fabrication-Pack Generation from Weeks to Minutes</strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"style\":{\"elements\":{\"link\":{\"color\":{\"text\":\"var:preset|color|black\"}}}},\"textColor\":\"black\"} -->\n<p class=\"has-black-color has-text-color has-link-color\">An Oil and Gas engineering organization used Artisan to automate fabrication-package generation for standardized modular well-pad configurations improving speed, consistency and repeatability.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"style\":{\"elements\":{\"link\":{\"color\":{\"text\":\"var:preset|color|black\"}}}},\"textColor\":\"black\"} -->\n<p class=\"has-black-color has-text-color has-link-color\"><br><strong>Results at a Glance</strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"style\":{\"elements\":{\"link\":{\"color\":{\"text\":\"var:preset|color|black\"}}}},\"textColor\":\"black\"} -->\n<p class=\"has-black-color has-text-color has-link-color\"><strong>198 Artifacts</strong> - Producer Module package generated in approximately 12 minutes</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"style\":{\"elements\":{\"link\":{\"color\":{\"text\":\"var:preset|color|black\"}}}},\"textColor\":\"black\"} -->\n<p class=\"has-black-color has-text-color has-link-color\"><strong>336 Artifacts</strong> - Double Injector package generated in approximately 24 minutes</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"style\":{\"elements\":{\"link\":{\"color\":{\"text\":\"var:preset|color|black\"}}}},\"textColor\":\"black\"} -->\n<p class=\"has-black-color has-text-color has-link-color\"><strong>Weeks to 8 Minutes</strong> - Reported execution-time improvement across the broader deployment</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"style\":{\"elements\":{\"link\":{\"color\":{\"text\":\"var:preset|color|black\"}}}},\"textColor\":\"black\"} -->\n<p class=\"has-black-color has-text-color has-link-color\"><br><strong>Project Overview</strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"style\":{\"elements\":{\"link\":{\"color\":{\"text\":\"var:preset|color|black\"}}}},\"textColor\":\"black\"} -->\n<p class=\"has-black-color has-text-color has-link-color\"><strong>Industry:</strong> Oil and Gas and EPC</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"style\":{\"elements\":{\"link\":{\"color\":{\"text\":\"var:preset|color|black\"}}}},\"textColor\":\"black\"} -->\n<p class=\"has-black-color has-text-color has-link-color\"><strong>Application:</strong> Modular SAGD Well-Pad Infrastructure</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"style\":{\"elements\":{\"link\":{\"color\":{\"text\":\"var:preset|color|black\"}}}},\"textColor\":\"black\"} -->\n<p class=\"has-black-color has-text-color has-link-color\"><strong>Solution:</strong> Artisan - Diagram and Document Generation System</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"style\":{\"elements\":{\"link\":{\"color\":{\"text\":\"var:preset|color|black\"}}}},\"textColor\":\"black\"} -->\n<p class=\"has-black-color has-text-color has-link-color\"><strong>Outputs:</strong> Engineering Drawings, Datasheets and Fabrication Documents</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"style\":{\"elements\":{\"link\":{\"color\":{\"text\":\"var:preset|color|black\"}}}},\"textColor\":\"black\"} -->\n<p class=\"has-black-color has-text-color has-link-color\"></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"style\":{\"elements\":{\"link\":{\"color\":{\"text\":\"var:preset|color|black\"}}}},\"textColor\":\"black\"} -->\n<p class=\"has-black-color has-text-color has-link-color\"><strong>The Challenge</strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"style\":{\"elements\":{\"link\":{\"color\":{\"text\":\"var:preset|color|black\"}}}},\"textColor\":\"black\"} -->\n<p class=\"has-black-color has-text-color has-link-color\">Modular SAGD well-pad facilities used standardized designs, but each configuration still required extensive engineering and fabrication documentation.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"style\":{\"elements\":{\"link\":{\"color\":{\"text\":\"var:preset|color|black\"}}}},\"textColor\":\"black\"} -->\n<p class=\"has-black-color has-text-color has-link-color\"><strong>Key Challenges</strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:list {\"style\":{\"elements\":{\"link\":{\"color\":{\"text\":\"var:preset|color|black\"}}}},\"textColor\":\"black\"} -->\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list has-black-color has-text-color has-link-color\"><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Extensive manual drafting and document preparation</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Repeated formatting across similar deliverables</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>High document volumes</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Delays, inconsistencies and avoidable rework</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Time-consuming adaptation of standard designs</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Difficulty maintaining consistent outputs</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Limited scalability across configurations</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"style\":{\"elements\":{\"link\":{\"color\":{\"text\":\"var:preset|color|black\"}}}},\"textColor\":\"black\"} -->\n<p class=\"has-black-color has-text-color has-link-color\"><br><strong>Before Artisan</strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"style\":{\"elements\":{\"link\":{\"color\":{\"text\":\"var:preset|color|black\"}}}},\"textColor\":\"black\"} -->\n<p class=\"has-black-color has-text-color has-link-color\"><strong>Engineering Inputs \u2192 Manual Drafting \u2192 Document Assembly \u2192 Quality Review \u2192 Fabrication Package</strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"style\":{\"elements\":{\"link\":{\"color\":{\"text\":\"var:preset|color|black\"}}}},\"textColor\":\"black\"} -->\n<p class=\"has-black-color has-text-color has-link-color\">Even when the design was standardized, each package required substantial manual engineering effort.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"style\":{\"elements\":{\"link\":{\"color\":{\"text\":\"var:preset|color|black\"}}}},\"textColor\":\"black\"} -->\n<p class=\"has-black-color has-text-color has-link-color\"><strong>The Solution</strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"style\":{\"elements\":{\"link\":{\"color\":{\"text\":\"var:preset|color|black\"}}}},\"textColor\":\"black\"} -->\n<p class=\"has-black-color has-text-color has-link-color\">Drishya AI developed a Diagram and Document Generation System using the Artisan platform.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"style\":{\"elements\":{\"link\":{\"color\":{\"text\":\"var:preset|color|black\"}}}},\"textColor\":\"black\"} -->\n<p class=\"has-black-color has-text-color has-link-color\">The system connected engineering inputs within a contextual model and used approved templates to adapt standardized designs for specific configurations.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"style\":{\"elements\":{\"link\":{\"color\":{\"text\":\"var:preset|color|black\"}}}},\"textColor\":\"black\"} -->\n<p class=\"has-black-color has-text-color has-link-color\"><strong>The Solution Included</strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:list {\"style\":{\"elements\":{\"link\":{\"color\":{\"text\":\"var:preset|color|black\"}}}},\"textColor\":\"black\"} -->\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list has-black-color has-text-color has-link-color\"><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>DWG cleaning and templating</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Centralized template database</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Automated order assembly</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Document and diagram generation</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Automated tagging and naming</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Audit database</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>User access controls</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>System-health monitoring</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Contextual engineering-data modelling</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Configuration-based template adaptation</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"style\":{\"elements\":{\"link\":{\"color\":{\"text\":\"var:preset|color|black\"}}}},\"textColor\":\"black\"} -->\n<p class=\"has-black-color has-text-color has-link-color\"><strong>Engineering Inputs Included</strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\"><!-- wp:list-item {\"style\":{\"elements\":{\"link\":{\"color\":{\"text\":\"var:preset|color|black\"}}}},\"textColor\":\"black\"} -->\n<li class=\"has-black-color has-text-color has-link-color\">Piping and Instrumentation Diagrams</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item {\"style\":{\"elements\":{\"link\":{\"color\":{\"text\":\"var:preset|color|black\"}}}},\"textColor\":\"black\"} -->\n<li class=\"has-black-color has-text-color has-link-color\">Process Flow Diagrams</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item {\"style\":{\"elements\":{\"link\":{\"color\":{\"text\":\"var:preset|color|black\"}}}},\"textColor\":\"black\"} -->\n<li class=\"has-black-color has-text-color has-link-color\">Heat and Material Balances</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item {\"style\":{\"elements\":{\"link\":{\"color\":{\"text\":\"var:preset|color|black\"}}}},\"textColor\":\"black\"} -->\n<li class=\"has-black-color has-text-color has-link-color\">Mechanical datasheets</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item {\"style\":{\"elements\":{\"link\":{\"color\":{\"text\":\"var:preset|color|black\"}}}},\"textColor\":\"black\"} -->\n<li class=\"has-black-color has-text-color has-link-color\">Pressure Safety Valve datasheets<br></li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"style\":{\"elements\":{\"link\":{\"color\":{\"text\":\"var:preset|color|black\"}}}},\"textColor\":\"black\"} -->\n<p class=\"has-black-color has-text-color has-link-color\"><strong>How Artisan Works</strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"style\":{\"elements\":{\"link\":{\"color\":{\"text\":\"var:preset|color|black\"}}}},\"textColor\":\"black\"} -->\n<p class=\"has-black-color has-text-color has-link-color\"><strong>Engineering Inputs \u2192 Contextual Model \u2192 Approved Templates \u2192 Automated Generation \u2192 Fabrication Package</strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"style\":{\"elements\":{\"link\":{\"color\":{\"text\":\"var:preset|color|black\"}}}},\"textColor\":\"black\"} -->\n<p class=\"has-black-color has-text-color has-link-color\">Artisan structures the engineering information, applies configuration requirements, selects approved templates and automatically produces the required fabrication documents.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:html -->\n<style>\n.before-after-table {\n    width: 100%;\n    border-collapse: collapse;\n    font-family: 'Poppins', sans-serif;\n    margin: 20px 0;\n}\n\n.before-after-table th {\n    font-size: 20px;\n    font-weight: 600;\n    padding: 18px 20px;\n    text-align: left;\n    border: 1px solid #ddd;\n}\n\n.before-after-table td {\n    font-size: 15px;\n    font-weight: 400;\n    padding: 16px 20px;\n    text-align: left;\n    border: 1px solid #e5e5e5;\n    color: #333;\n}\n\n.before-after-table th:first-child,\n.before-after-table th:last-child {\n    width: 50%;\n}\n\n@media (max-width: 767px) {\n    .before-after-table th {\n        font-size: 18px;\n        padding: 14px 12px;\n    }\n\n    .before-after-table td {\n        font-size: 14px;\n        padding: 13px 12px;\n    }\n}\n</style>\n\n<table class=\"before-after-table\">\n    <thead>\n        <tr>\n            <th>Before</th>\n            <th>After</th>\n        </tr>\n    </thead>\n\n    <tbody>\n        <tr>\n            <td>Manual drafting</td>\n            <td>Automated generation</td>\n        </tr>\n\n        <tr>\n            <td>Repeated document assembly</td>\n            <td>Template-driven production</td>\n        </tr>\n\n        <tr>\n            <td>Individual file preparation</td>\n            <td>Coordinated package generation</td>\n        </tr>\n\n        <tr>\n            <td>Inconsistent formatting</td>\n            <td>Standardized outputs</td>\n        </tr>\n\n        <tr>\n            <td>Manual tagging and naming</td>\n            <td>Automated document controls</td>\n        </tr>\n\n        <tr>\n            <td>Week-scale execution</td>\n            <td>Minute-scale execution</td>\n        </tr>\n    </tbody>\n</table>\n<!-- /wp:html -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"style\":{\"elements\":{\"link\":{\"color\":{\"text\":\"var:preset|color|black\"}}}},\"textColor\":\"black\"} -->\n<p class=\"has-black-color has-text-color has-link-color\"><strong>Business Impact</strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"style\":{\"elements\":{\"link\":{\"color\":{\"text\":\"var:preset|color|black\"}}}},\"textColor\":\"black\"} -->\n<p class=\"has-black-color has-text-color has-link-color\"><strong>198 Artifacts in Approximately 12 Minutes</strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"style\":{\"elements\":{\"link\":{\"color\":{\"text\":\"var:preset|color|black\"}}}},\"textColor\":\"black\"} -->\n<p class=\"has-black-color has-text-color has-link-color\">Artisan generated 198 artifacts for a Producer Module.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"style\":{\"elements\":{\"link\":{\"color\":{\"text\":\"var:preset|color|black\"}}}},\"textColor\":\"black\"} -->\n<p class=\"has-black-color has-text-color has-link-color\"><strong>336 Artifacts in Approximately 24 Minutes</strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"style\":{\"elements\":{\"link\":{\"color\":{\"text\":\"var:preset|color|black\"}}}},\"textColor\":\"black\"} -->\n<p class=\"has-black-color has-text-color has-link-color\">Artisan generated 336 artifacts for a Double Injector configuration.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"style\":{\"elements\":{\"link\":{\"color\":{\"text\":\"var:preset|color|black\"}}}},\"textColor\":\"black\"} -->\n<p class=\"has-black-color has-text-color has-link-color\"><strong>Weeks to Approximately 8 Minutes</strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"style\":{\"elements\":{\"link\":{\"color\":{\"text\":\"var:preset|color|black\"}}}},\"textColor\":\"black\"} -->\n<p class=\"has-black-color has-text-color has-link-color\">Across the broader deployment, fabrication-pack execution was reported to have decreased from weeks to approximately eight minutes.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"style\":{\"elements\":{\"link\":{\"color\":{\"text\":\"var:preset|color|black\"}}}},\"textColor\":\"black\"} -->\n<p class=\"has-black-color has-text-color has-link-color\"><strong>The Results</strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:list {\"style\":{\"elements\":{\"link\":{\"color\":{\"text\":\"var:preset|color|black\"}}}},\"textColor\":\"black\"} -->\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list has-black-color has-text-color has-link-color\"><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Automated fabrication-package generation and assembly</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Improved repeatability across modular configurations</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Reduced manual drafting and document preparation</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Increased consistency across engineering outputs</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Accelerated adaptation of standardized designs</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Strengthened auditability and document control</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Created a scalable foundation for modular projects</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"style\":{\"elements\":{\"link\":{\"color\":{\"text\":\"var:preset|color|black\"}}}},\"textColor\":\"black\"} -->\n<p class=\"has-black-color has-text-color has-link-color\"><br><strong>Key Takeaway</strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"style\":{\"elements\":{\"link\":{\"color\":{\"text\":\"var:preset|color|black\"}}}},\"textColor\":\"black\"} -->\n<p class=\"has-black-color has-text-color has-link-color\">Artisan transformed fabrication-pack generation from a manual, week-scale engineering activity into a repeatable automated process measured in minutes.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->", "rendered": "\n<p class=\"has-black-color has-text-color has-link-color has-medium-font-size wp-elements-81 wp-block-paragraph\"><strong>How Artisan Reduced Fabrication-Pack Generation from Weeks to Minutes</strong></p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"has-black-color has-text-color has-link-color wp-elements-82 wp-block-paragraph\">An Oil and Gas engineering organization used Artisan to automate fabrication-package generation for standardized modular well-pad configurations improving speed, consistency and repeatability.</p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"has-black-color has-text-color has-link-color wp-elements-83 wp-block-paragraph\"><br><strong>Results at a Glance</strong></p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"has-black-color has-text-color has-link-color wp-elements-84 wp-block-paragraph\"><strong>198 Artifacts</strong> &#8211; Producer Module package generated in approximately 12 minutes</p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"has-black-color has-text-color has-link-color wp-elements-85 wp-block-paragraph\"><strong>336 Artifacts</strong> &#8211; Double Injector package generated in approximately 24 minutes</p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"has-black-color has-text-color has-link-color wp-elements-86 wp-block-paragraph\"><strong>Weeks to 8 Minutes</strong> &#8211; Reported execution-time improvement across the broader deployment</p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"has-black-color has-text-color has-link-color wp-elements-87 wp-block-paragraph\"><br><strong>Project Overview</strong></p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"has-black-color has-text-color has-link-color wp-elements-88 wp-block-paragraph\"><strong>Industry:</strong> Oil and Gas and EPC</p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"has-black-color has-text-color has-link-color wp-elements-89 wp-block-paragraph\"><strong>Application:</strong> Modular SAGD Well-Pad Infrastructure</p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"has-black-color has-text-color has-link-color wp-elements-90 wp-block-paragraph\"><strong>Solution:</strong> Artisan &#8211; Diagram and Document Generation System</p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"has-black-color has-text-color has-link-color wp-elements-91 wp-block-paragraph\"><strong>Outputs:</strong> Engineering Drawings, Datasheets and Fabrication Documents</p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"has-black-color has-text-color has-link-color wp-elements-92 wp-block-paragraph\"></p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"has-black-color has-text-color has-link-color wp-elements-93 wp-block-paragraph\"><strong>The Challenge</strong></p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"has-black-color has-text-color has-link-color wp-elements-94 wp-block-paragraph\">Modular SAGD well-pad facilities used standardized designs, but each configuration still required extensive engineering and fabrication documentation.</p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"has-black-color has-text-color has-link-color wp-elements-95 wp-block-paragraph\"><strong>Key Challenges</strong></p>\n\n\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list has-black-color has-text-color has-link-color wp-elements-96\">\n<li>Extensive manual drafting and document preparation</li>\n\n\n\n<li>Repeated formatting across similar deliverables</li>\n\n\n\n<li>High document volumes</li>\n\n\n\n<li>Delays, inconsistencies and avoidable rework</li>\n\n\n\n<li>Time-consuming adaptation of standard designs</li>\n\n\n\n<li>Difficulty maintaining consistent outputs</li>\n\n\n\n<li>Limited scalability across configurations</li>\n</ul>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"has-black-color has-text-color has-link-color wp-elements-97 wp-block-paragraph\"><br><strong>Before Artisan</strong></p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"has-black-color has-text-color has-link-color wp-elements-98 wp-block-paragraph\"><strong>Engineering Inputs \u2192 Manual Drafting \u2192 Document Assembly \u2192 Quality Review \u2192 Fabrication Package</strong></p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"has-black-color has-text-color has-link-color wp-elements-99 wp-block-paragraph\">Even when the design was standardized, each package required substantial manual engineering effort.</p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"has-black-color has-text-color has-link-color wp-elements-100 wp-block-paragraph\"><strong>The Solution</strong></p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"has-black-color has-text-color has-link-color wp-elements-101 wp-block-paragraph\">Drishya AI developed a Diagram and Document Generation System using the Artisan platform.</p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"has-black-color has-text-color has-link-color wp-elements-102 wp-block-paragraph\">The system connected engineering inputs within a contextual model and used approved templates to adapt standardized designs for specific configurations.</p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"has-black-color has-text-color has-link-color wp-elements-103 wp-block-paragraph\"><strong>The Solution Included</strong></p>\n\n\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list has-black-color has-text-color has-link-color wp-elements-104\">\n<li>DWG cleaning and templating</li>\n\n\n\n<li>Centralized template database</li>\n\n\n\n<li>Automated order assembly</li>\n\n\n\n<li>Document and diagram generation</li>\n\n\n\n<li>Automated tagging and naming</li>\n\n\n\n<li>Audit database</li>\n\n\n\n<li>User access controls</li>\n\n\n\n<li>System-health monitoring</li>\n\n\n\n<li>Contextual engineering-data modelling</li>\n\n\n\n<li>Configuration-based template adaptation</li>\n</ul>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"has-black-color has-text-color has-link-color wp-elements-105 wp-block-paragraph\"><strong>Engineering Inputs Included</strong></p>\n\n\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li class=\"has-black-color has-text-color has-link-color wp-elements-106\">Piping and Instrumentation Diagrams</li>\n\n\n\n<li class=\"has-black-color has-text-color has-link-color wp-elements-107\">Process Flow Diagrams</li>\n\n\n\n<li class=\"has-black-color has-text-color has-link-color wp-elements-108\">Heat and Material Balances</li>\n\n\n\n<li class=\"has-black-color has-text-color has-link-color wp-elements-109\">Mechanical datasheets</li>\n\n\n\n<li class=\"has-black-color has-text-color has-link-color wp-elements-110\">Pressure Safety Valve datasheets<br></li>\n</ul>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"has-black-color has-text-color has-link-color wp-elements-111 wp-block-paragraph\"><strong>How Artisan Works</strong></p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"has-black-color has-text-color has-link-color wp-elements-112 wp-block-paragraph\"><strong>Engineering Inputs \u2192 Contextual Model \u2192 Approved Templates \u2192 Automated Generation \u2192 Fabrication Package</strong></p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"has-black-color has-text-color has-link-color wp-elements-113 wp-block-paragraph\">Artisan structures the engineering information, applies configuration requirements, selects approved templates and automatically produces the required fabrication documents.</p>\n\n\n\n<style>\n.before-after-table {\n    width: 100%;\n    border-collapse: collapse;\n    font-family: 'Poppins', sans-serif;\n    margin: 20px 0;\n}\n\n.before-after-table th {\n    font-size: 20px;\n    font-weight: 600;\n    padding: 18px 20px;\n    text-align: left;\n    border: 1px solid #ddd;\n}\n\n.before-after-table td {\n    font-size: 15px;\n    font-weight: 400;\n    padding: 16px 20px;\n    text-align: left;\n    border: 1px solid #e5e5e5;\n    color: #333;\n}\n\n.before-after-table th:first-child,\n.before-after-table th:last-child {\n    width: 50%;\n}\n\n@media (max-width: 767px) {\n    .before-after-table th {\n        font-size: 18px;\n        padding: 14px 12px;\n    }\n\n    .before-after-table td {\n        font-size: 14px;\n        padding: 13px 12px;\n    }\n}\n</style>\n\n<table class=\"before-after-table\">\n    <thead>\n        <tr>\n            <th>Before</th>\n            <th>After</th>\n        </tr>\n    </thead>\n\n    <tbody>\n        <tr>\n            <td>Manual drafting</td>\n            <td>Automated generation</td>\n        </tr>\n\n        <tr>\n            <td>Repeated document assembly</td>\n            <td>Template-driven production</td>\n        </tr>\n\n        <tr>\n            <td>Individual file preparation</td>\n            <td>Coordinated package generation</td>\n        </tr>\n\n        <tr>\n            <td>Inconsistent formatting</td>\n            <td>Standardized outputs</td>\n        </tr>\n\n        <tr>\n            <td>Manual tagging and naming</td>\n            <td>Automated document controls</td>\n        </tr>\n\n        <tr>\n            <td>Week-scale execution</td>\n            <td>Minute-scale execution</td>\n        </tr>\n    </tbody>\n</table>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"></p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"has-black-color has-text-color has-link-color wp-elements-114 wp-block-paragraph\"><strong>Business Impact</strong></p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"has-black-color has-text-color has-link-color wp-elements-115 wp-block-paragraph\"><strong>198 Artifacts in Approximately 12 Minutes</strong></p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"has-black-color has-text-color has-link-color wp-elements-116 wp-block-paragraph\">Artisan generated 198 artifacts for a Producer Module.</p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"has-black-color has-text-color has-link-color wp-elements-117 wp-block-paragraph\"><strong>336 Artifacts in Approximately 24 Minutes</strong></p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"has-black-color has-text-color has-link-color wp-elements-118 wp-block-paragraph\">Artisan generated 336 artifacts for a Double Injector configuration.</p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"has-black-color has-text-color has-link-color wp-elements-119 wp-block-paragraph\"><strong>Weeks to Approximately 8 Minutes</strong></p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"has-black-color has-text-color has-link-color wp-elements-120 wp-block-paragraph\">Across the broader deployment, fabrication-pack execution was reported to have decreased from weeks to approximately eight minutes.</p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"></p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"has-black-color has-text-color has-link-color wp-elements-121 wp-block-paragraph\"><strong>The Results</strong></p>\n\n\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list has-black-color has-text-color has-link-color wp-elements-122\">\n<li>Automated fabrication-package generation and assembly</li>\n\n\n\n<li>Improved repeatability across modular configurations</li>\n\n\n\n<li>Reduced manual drafting and document preparation</li>\n\n\n\n<li>Increased consistency across engineering outputs</li>\n\n\n\n<li>Accelerated adaptation of standardized designs</li>\n\n\n\n<li>Strengthened auditability and document control</li>\n\n\n\n<li>Created a scalable foundation for modular projects</li>\n</ul>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"has-black-color has-text-color has-link-color wp-elements-123 wp-block-paragraph\"><br><strong>Key Takeaway</strong></p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"has-black-color has-text-color has-link-color wp-elements-124 wp-block-paragraph\">Artisan transformed fabrication-pack generation from a manual, week-scale engineering activity into a repeatable automated process measured in minutes.</p>\n", "protected": false, "block_version": 1}, "excerpt": {"raw": "", "rendered": "<p>How Artisan Reduced Fabrication-Pack Generation from Weeks to Minutes An Oil and Gas engineering organization used Artisan to automate fabrication-package generation for standardized modular well-pad configurations improving speed, consistency and repeatability. Results at a Glance 198 Artifacts &#8211; Producer Module package generated in approximately 12 minutes 336 Artifacts &#8211; Double Injector package generated in approximately [&hellip;]</p>\n", "protected": false}, "author": 1, "featured_media": 7329, "comment_status": "open", "ping_status": "open", "sticky": false, "template": "", "format": "standard", "meta": {"footnotes": "", "_elementor_edit_mode": "", "_elementor_template_type": "", "_elementor_data": "", "_elementor_page_settings": null, "_elementor_conditions": []}, "categories": [122, 120], "tags": [], "permalink_template": "https://artibits.com/2026/09/01/%postname%/", "generated_slug": "fabrication-pack-automation-for-modular-well-pad-infrastructure", "class_list": ["post-7419", "post", "type-post", "status-publish", "format-standard", "has-post-thumbnail", "hentry", "category-epc", "category-oil-gas"], "_links": {"self": [{"href": "https://artibits.com/wp-json/wp/v2/posts/7419", "targetHints": {"allow": ["GET", "POST", "PUT", "PATCH", "DELETE"]}}], "collection": [{"href": "https://artibits.com/wp-json/wp/v2/posts"}], "about": [{"href": "https: